                <pb facs="0390" n="288" xml:id="pg288"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/4377: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-01-06T19:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">January 6,
                                1927—7 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 7—11:10
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Legation guard arrived here at noon and it is now on duty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
